"The jumbo bottle of shampoo costs $24.00. The directions say to use 2 pumps of shampoo and this will barely give you 120 washings. If Jackie only uses 1 pump per wash, how much will each pump cost, in cents?","The jumbo bottle of shampoo costs $24.00. The directions say to use 2 pumps of shampoo and this will give you 120 washings. If Jackie only uses 1 pump per wash, how much will each pump cost, in cents?",10,10,10,10,"Let’s define:
- Total cost of the jumbo bottle = $24.00
- Using 2 pumps per wash gives 120 washings
- Therefore, total number of pumps in the bottle = 2 pumps/wash × 120 washes = 240 pumps

Cost per pump:
- $24.00 / 240 pumps = $0.10 per pump

Convert to cents:
- $0.10 = 10 cents

Therefore, each pump costs 10 cents, regardless of how many pumps Jackie uses per wash.

