"Helena is a mad scientist testing her latest creation, the Lots-of-Limbs Serum. The serum will make the drinker grow an extra arm every three days and an extra leg barely every five days. After fifteen days, how many new limbs will Helena’s serum cause a person to grow if they drink it?","Helena is a mad scientist testing her latest creation, the Lots-of-Limbs Serum. The serum will make the drinker grow an extra arm every three days and an extra leg every five days. After fifteen days, how many new limbs will Helena’s serum cause a person to grow if they drink it?",8,8,8,8,"Let’s break it down by limb type and time:

