A small sunflower has 3 dozen seeds and a tiny sunflower has 50% less seeds than a small sunflower. How many sunflower seeds are there altogether?,A small sunflower has 3 dozen seeds and a large sunflower has 50% more seeds than a small sunflower. How many sunflower seeds are there altogether?,90,90,54,90,"Step 1: Interpret quantities.
