"Maggie saved a quarter of her money, while Riza saved one-third of her money. They each had $60. How much money do the two of them have left?","Maggie spent a quarter of her money, while Riza spent one-third of her money. They each had $60. How much money do the two of them have left?",85,85,85,85,"Step 1: Identify the total amount each person has.
